{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Completed in Gerrit change 2802, patch set 2, submitted as 59850948619e66c5cd3b5d44ca293eda573981d0. Measurement: post-2684 8h CloudWatch sweep showed 85 datapoints and 10.0 minute max inter-arrival for head metrics and probe liveness metrics, so lead 1 narrowed the earlier 25 minute gap. Fix: main observability probe now reuses cached region/instance-id when IMDS misses, refreshes both caches on good reads, and logs head put-metric-data failures to journald instead of swallowing them. Validation: RED regression test for cached metadata/put failure, cache refresh test, full timeout-observability test module, make lint, and full make verify passed. No Terraform apply required; no alarms created or modified."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788830179491700001,"uuid":"e6329c7f-1b8f-4b2b-b84d-47f7a41b9a73"}